00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:23.430
So BigQuery is Google
Cloud's enterprise class data

00:01:23.430 --> 00:01:24.610
warehouse.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:29.140
We have customers who
have petabytes of data,

00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:30.910
and you can actually
write a single query

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:34.090
